<title>USA: American Greetings Q3 net rises.</title>
<headline>American Greetings Q3 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>CLEVELAND 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.00		    $0.24</p>
<p> Net			 74,597		   17,484</p>
<p> Sales		    647,723		  587,602</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  74,837		   74,617</p>
<p>	  9  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr		 $1.52		    $0.94</p>
<p> Net		 113,798		  69,813</p>
<p> Sales	     1,552,471		1,457,282</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  74,781		   74,488</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: First Call earnings estimate for Q3 1996 was $0.97 per share.</p>
<p>1995 includes $52 million write-down on assets of CreataCard. Before this, the company earned $52.6 million or $0.71 per share in Q3 1995 and $104.9 million or $1.41 per share for the nine-months.</p>
<p>Full company name is American Greetings Corp.</p>
</text>
